# features.d/alpine-fde.files — mkinitfs feature file list for the
# alpine-fde Early-Boot Unseal Hook (docs/Architecture.md §8.2; ADR-13,
# gap G-C8). `alpine-fde install` copies this file to
# /etc/mkinitfs/features.d/alpine-fde.files and registers the `alpine-fde`
# feature in /etc/mkinitfs/mkinitfs.conf (mkinitfs packs a feature's entries
# ONLY when the feature is enabled there — §8.2/ADR-13 staging contract,
# tests/unit/featuresd_contract.sh); every file the unseal hook needs
# inside the initramfs is listed here (absolute target-root paths, globs
# allowed). mkinitfs resolves these paths against the TARGET tree at build
# time, so the first entry below is also the ONE pinned destination where
# `install` stages the hook itself (§9.1 step 7):
#   * the hook script itself
#   * cryptsetup + libcrypto (openssl) for the unlock + signature gate
#   * the exact tpm2-tools verbs the hook runs + libtss2 (ESYS stack incl.
#     the device TCTI)
#   * TPM kernel modules + the TPM udev rule (creates /dev/tpmrm0)
#   * root filesystem drivers (btrfs default, ext4 optional) and the bcache
#     block driver + its udev rule for hybrid topologies (§4.1)
/usr/share/alpine-fde/mkinitfs/alpine-fde-unseal.sh
/usr/bin/cryptsetup
/usr/lib/libcryptsetup.so*
/usr/bin/openssl
/usr/lib/libcrypto.so*
/usr/lib/libssl.so*
/usr/bin/tpm2_pcrextend
/usr/bin/tpm2_startauthsession
/usr/bin/tpm2_policypcr
/usr/bin/tpm2_policyauthorize
/usr/bin/tpm2_loadexternal
/usr/bin/tpm2_verifysignature
/usr/bin/tpm2_createprimary
/usr/bin/tpm2_load
/usr/bin/tpm2_unseal
/usr/bin/tpm2_flushcontext
/usr/lib/libtss2-esys.so*
/usr/lib/libtss2-mu.so*
/usr/lib/libtss2-rc.so*
/usr/lib/libtss2-sys.so*
/usr/lib/libtss2-tctildr.so*
/usr/lib/libtss2-tcti-device.so*
/lib/modules/*/kernel/drivers/char/tpm/tpm.ko*
/lib/modules/*/kernel/drivers/char/tpm/tpm_tis.ko*
/lib/modules/*/kernel/drivers/char/tpm/tpm_crb.ko*
/usr/lib/udev/rules.d/*tpm*.rules
/lib/modules/*/kernel/fs/btrfs/btrfs.ko*
/lib/modules/*/kernel/fs/ext4/ext4.ko*
/lib/modules/*/kernel/fs/jbd2/jbd2.ko*
/lib/modules/*/kernel/fs/mbcache/mbcache.ko*
/lib/modules/*/kernel/drivers/md/bcache/bcache.ko*
/usr/lib/udev/rules.d/69-bcache.rules
